flowchart TD
    A[Community Member] -->|Web chat / SMS| B[Foyer Orchestrator]
    A2[Donor] -->|Web chat / SMS| B

    B -->|routes| C[Front Desk Sub-Agent]
    B -->|routes| D[Donor Steward Sub-Agent]

    C --> C1[get_event_info]
    C --> C2[make_rsvp]
    D --> D1[get_donor_profile]
    D --> D2[check_lapsing_donors]
    D --> D3[draft_followup_message]

    C -->|low risk| E[Replies immediately]
    D -->|donor-facing| F{Approval Gate}

    F -->|human approves| G[Message sent]
    F -->|human rejects| H[Discarded]

    C --> I[(Decision Log)]
    D --> I
    F --> I
    I --> J[Admin Dashboard]

    K[(events / donors / rsvps)] --> C1
    K --> C2
    K --> D1
    K --> D2
    K --> D3
